    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llGetCameraAspect();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float value for the current camera&#39;s aspect ratio (e.g. width/height) of the agent for which the task has permissions.</p>
  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_TRACK_CAMERA" target="_blank">PERMISSION_TRACK_CAMERA</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>.</p>
</p>
